}}'''Leaves Knife (Summer 2025)''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that was originally obtainable during the [[Summer Event 2025]] by collecting 800 '''Beach Balls''' {{Currency|Beach Ball}} and purchasing the 2nd tier. It is now only available through trading as the event has ended.

== Appearance ==
The blade of this knife is a vibrant shade of orange. There is a sun visible, along with multiple leaves, each diversely shaped. The guard is a golden color, while the handle is black.
